  "translation": "I went to the park with my mom on the weekend. We walked in, and there were many flowers inside. Mom asked, 'Which one do you like?' I pointed at the reddest one. We continued walking forward and saw a stream. There were fish in the stream. I wanted to count them, but the fish swam too fast. Later we sat on a bench to rest. I was a bit hungry, so I ate bread. Mom drank a cup of water. We stayed until the afternoon before going home. Today was really happy!"
